                            <comment id="499690" author="JIRAUSER22000" created="Sun, 16 Aug 2026 06:07:53 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Similar to EX-7748 and identical to EX-14075.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Maloo search showes this failure only happens on SLES 15 SP7.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Testlog showes this failure has a high rate comes from MPI. Every user process is blocked in MPI Barrier, and then Lnet cannot find eth0. Although there is no direct envidence to show the connection, these two errors may be causally related.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
